 "served_paragraph": "The arithmetic still answers part of this. If MRR is Monthly Pro price × Pro paying subscribers (Olumi’s reading of your goal): at £49/month and 250 Pro paying subscribers (Olumi’s estimate), MRR is £12,250/month today. At £59/month, MRR stays at least that while 208 or more of the 250 stay (a loss of at most 42). £20,000/month needs 339 at £59/month or 409 at £49/month. This is arithmetic on these figures, not the analysis ranking the options, and it says nothing about how many will stay.",
